SUMMARY:Evening at the Baden Thermal Baths ♨️🍷
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/2026-10-17-baden-baths/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/,+Heisse+Brunnen/@47.4863649,8.2950497,16.04z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47906d18f358e1d7:0x36008e6a9cea1f3e!8m2!3d47.4815162!4d8.3135997!16s%2Fg%2F11s19r92qg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Baden - Heisse Brunnen (outdoor thermal baths)</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Timon Fopp (<a class="link" href="mailto:timon.fopp@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">timon.fopp@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41783309888">+41783309888</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd8aPI0h8u9JI1ie6broF_E3UW2syvNj9oGkBwzXzKr1jNmxw/viewform?usp=publish-editor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Registration form</a>\n\n<p>It&rsquo;s that time of year again! ♨️ This Saturday we&rsquo;re heading to the outdoor thermal baths in Baden for an evening of pure relaxation in 45°C water.</p> <h2 id="date--time">Date &amp; Time</h2> <p><strong>Saturday, October 17, 2026 at 19:00</strong></p> <h2 id="what-to-expect">What to Expect</h2> <ul> <li>🆓 <strong>Free entry</strong> - the baths are open to the public at no cost</li> <li>🍷 <strong>Wine, beer and snacks</strong> will be provided</li> <li>♨️ Hot thermal water (~45°C) under the evening sky</li> </ul> <h2 id="getting-there">Getting There</h2> <p>Take an SBB train from <strong>Zürich HB</strong> to <strong>Baden</strong> station. From there it&rsquo;s just a short walk to the <a class="link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/,&#43;Heisse&#43;Brunnen/@47.4863649,8.2950497,16.04z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47906d18f358e1d7:0x36008e6a9cea1f3e!8m2!3d47.4815162!4d8.3135997!16s%2Fg%2F11s19r92qg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Heisse Brunnen</a>. 🚆</p>
